      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Kindly Note: \ni) Viewings strictly by appointment. To schedule a viewing contact : Daniel via Email: 1woodfordmeadows At gmail.com\nii) To see current offers and/or to submit a formal offer: www.swiftly.ie website -> the property listing -> follow the steps.\n---------------\nSwiftly is delighted to bring to market 1 Woodford Meadows, a beautifully maintained four-bedroom home located in a quiet, mature estate with excellent access to local amenities, schools, and transport links.\n\nThe accommodation begins with a bright entrance leading to a spacious front living room\nand an open-plan kitchen/dining area. A ground-floor bedroom with en-suite, currently used\nas a home gym, offers excellent flexibility for guests, remote working, or family needs.\n\nTo the rear, a generous extension provides a superb home office/entertainment room with\ndirect access to the garden. Upstairs comprises of three large bedrooms and a main family bathroom.\n\nThe attic is accessed via Stira folding stairs and provides ample additional storage. The rear garden is low-maintenance, featuring a combination of lawn, patio and decking areas. High garden walls and mature trees ensure the space is completely private and not overlooked. \n\nTo the side of the house there is a large workshop with ample space for bikes, bins, and storage. To the front, the property benefits from a driveway with space for two cars, along with additional on-street parking to the side.\n\nWoodford Meadow is ideally positioned within walking distance of Clondalkin Village and The Mill Shopping Centre, offering a wide range of shops, schools, restaurants, bars, and leisure facilities. The area is extremely well served by public transport, with a bus stop to the city centre just a 2-minute walk away and the Red Luas Line approximately 15 minutes on foot.\n\nThe M50 and N7 are also within easy reach, making commuting simple and efficient.\n\nAll planning permissions and certificates of compliance are in place and ready for a smooth\nsale process.\n\nKey Features\n- 140m²\n- BER C3\n- 4 bed, 2 bath\n- Prime location\n- Large Driveway at Front\n- Large Rear Garden\n- Double and Triple Glazed Windows\n- Workshop to Side with Access to Driveway and Back Garden\n- Excellent transport links"
      },
